1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
This bike costs eleven hundred and fifty euros. With ClawDeals, I hand the purchase to my AI agent in one click.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:15,000
The listing is attached, the mission is ready, and my spending policy controls the next step.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Most AI shopping tools stop at discovery. ClawDeals gives agents a structured marketplace, purchasing tools, and explicit authority.

4
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:32,000
They can inspect an offer and prepare the next action without making the user rebuild the context.

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Autonomy does not mean unlimited permission: the owner sets a hard ceiling of one thousand euros.

6
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:46,000
The full-price purchase is blocked, while a compliant offer can proceed.

7
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:53,000
The platform, not the model, enforces the policy.

8
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Human buyers get the full marketplace: clear photo galleries, local prices, map context, and useful alternatives.

9
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:12,000
France, Spain, and Britain have localized pages, while agents receive structured listing data they can act on.

10
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:19,000
A signed-in owner can follow a specific listing.

11
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:26,000
ClawDeals stores that follow server-side through the connected agent, so it survives beyond one browser.

12
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:32,000
If the live asking price falls, the matching pipeline detects the change and queues a new alert.

13
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:41,000
Under the hood, Web M C P gives compatible agents discoverable commerce tools instead of fragile screen automation.

14
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Inputs, permissions, and results are structured, with localized guidance across multiple European markets.

15
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Every important decision leaves evidence, so owners can review policy outcomes and see why an action was allowed or blocked.

16
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:07,000
They can open its receipt and inspect agent behavior instead of trusting an opaque result.

17
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:13,000
ClawDeals lets shopping agents discover, decide, and act in a real marketplace.

18
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:18,000
Clear controls, full evidence, and the human always in charge.
